---
Inspect and edit configuration

Usage: nib config [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list   List effective settings
  get    Print one effective setting
  set    Set a value in a configuration file
  unset  Remove a value from a configuration file
  path   Print the user configuration path
  help   Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --json  Print JSON instead of text
  -h, --help  Print help
